{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>ושפכתי</b> — I will pour out a spirit of grace and supplications upon the inhabitants of Jerusalem. Before this, trouble will first pass over them, for Messiah son of Joseph will be killed. Then HaShem will be angered and destroy all the nations that come against Jerusalem. This is <b>והביטו אלי</b> — then all the nations will look to me to see what I will do to those who pierced Messiah son of Joseph." "<b>וספדו עליו</b> — his men."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:55.033100027Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}